<p>Attack with your melee weapons for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">145%, 160%, 171%, 181%, 190%</acronym> weapon damage as physical and temporal (warp) damage. If either attack hits you may stun, blind, pin, or confuse the target for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p></p><p>Blade Threading talents will freely swap to your dual-weapons when activated if you have them in your secondary slots.  Additionally you may use the Attack talent in a similar manner.</p>